{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o025a","title":"刘备拒绝袭刘琮并携众南行","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o025a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"过襄阳时诸葛亮劝攻刘琮，刘备不忍；呼刘琮不出，荆州人随行至当阳，达十余万。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o025a-q"]},{"id":"dongliu-a-6f56066ca20dcf6cccdc","label":"正文","text":"刘备奔江南，荆楚群士从之","evidence":["dongliu-q-31a70cac001d7aed35dc"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"进言","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o025a-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"拒绝携众","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o025a-q"]},{"person":"liu-cong","role":"不出相见","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o025a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"襄阳、当阳","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o025a-q"]},"time":{"year":208,"label":"南避曹军时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y208","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o024","basis":"南避曹军时"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o025a-q","xianzhu-q-o024","wudi-q-o119","wudi-q-b-888495d8be7766faf20c"]},"source_order":[32,110,"O025a"],"order":6530}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-cong","name":"刘琮","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongliu-q-31a70cac001d7aed35dc","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-25116ac3db8470a65d86","layer":"original","quote":"先主奔江南，荆楚群士从之如云","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":9,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-888495d8be7766faf20c","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-888495d8be7766faf20c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":666,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0bae348fdb687025113d","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o119","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4bcffcc4ee709a4e5ea3","layer":"original","quote":"十三年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。作玄武池以肄舟师〖2〗。﹝一﹞汉罢三公官，置丞相、御史大夫〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":661,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o025a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-5a567c5b9888d0eedcf0","layer":"original","quote":"过襄阳，诸葛亮说先主攻琮，荆州可有。先主曰：“吾不忍也。”﹝三﹞乃驻马呼琮；琮惧，不能起；琮左右及荆州人多归先主。﹝四﹞比到当阳，众十余万，辎重数千辆，日行十余里；","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":109,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o024","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-c857386227851cc86ab3","layer":"original","quote":"（曹公南征表）〔及曹公南征〕，会表卒，﹝二﹞子琮代立〖2〗，遣使请降。先主屯樊，不知曹公猝至；至宛乃闻之，遂将其众去。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":59,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
